  "decision": "D-232",
  "method": "d232",
  "imageCalls": 0,
  "what": "the three limits D-231 found, corrected as general rules (method d232, fitCheck d232, seam-contract-v2) and re-run on the same pictures: the nine D-207 pilot pictures and D-228's 40-outfit matrix; no new picture, no retouch, no per-item rule",
  "corrections": {
    "edgeExit": {
      "rule": "extraction: a contour-thin line of the item hanging below a hem or a cuff, not of the garment's fabric colour and never over a base garment, is the limb's redrawn contour — it leaves the item (after the skin shadow); FIT-6v2 d232: a limb leaving a top or bottom at its end (a contour-wide piece within SLIVER_PX of the garment's lowest row, the body continuing below) is a reported exit, not a strip",
      "evidence": "D-228's V2 … V5 strips (3–4 × 8–11 px) all end at the garment's lowest row (0 / −6 rows); the sandals' strip lies 109 rows above its shoe's end (shoes are not concerned); half of each strip's pixels differed from the picture — the model drew the limb's contour 2–3 px off C's and rule (6) took it as garment edge",
      "sideEffect": "V2's cuff: d225 measured SC-S1 on the hanging contour (cuffY 845 / 839); its fabric ends at 837 / 834 — D-231's \"SC-S1 pass\" was that artefact"
    },
    "skinLikeAndDark": {
      "shadowHue": "a skin shadow may shift the hue (kG − kB) no more than C's own shading does (its maximum on C: 0.199; the pilot's and D-228's genuine shadows: p99 ≤ 0.20; the orange skirt: median 0.41)",
      "remnantChroma": "G-2 counts a base pixel unchanged only when its chroma (D-210 colourDist) is unchanged too: V3's dark olive 1133 → 0 px, the plum skirt's 307 → 0, the tank's real grey 56 → 55"
    },
    "hipLanes": {
      "contract": "seam-contract-v2: top at a station ≥ shorts + 6 (v1 + 8), bottoms ≤ shorts + 6 (v1 + 3), from a TEMPLATE sweep of the outfit check on C; every other rule v1's (the full-length band stays: it is coupled to the shoe envelope)"
    }
  },
